        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I don't think having this functionality (synchronization only of current buffer after `:w` or on `BufWritePost` event) meets reasonable threshold for \"features/complexity\" trade-off.\r\n\r\nTogether with mentioned earlier points, I think I'll close this as not planned.",
